WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.480
<b>Episode 12: 
The Best You Can Do</b>

00:00:16.660 --> 00:00:20.490
<i>What? Are you all done?</i>

00:00:22.540 --> 00:00:25.370
<i>Then you never need 
to rise to the surface again.</i>

00:00:26.130 --> 00:00:28.630
<i>Come with me... Let go of everything...</i>

00:00:29.290 --> 00:00:31.920
<i>Your war is over.</i>

00:00:32.720 --> 00:00:35.340
<i>Now slowly sink into the depths.</i>

00:02:11.560 --> 00:02:14.730
No... Jinzaburou!

00:02:15.280 --> 00:02:16.490
Mister...

00:02:18.450 --> 00:02:20.360
Help us, Tendou-sama!

00:02:21.160 --> 00:02:23.280
All the rest are worthless.

00:02:23.700 --> 00:02:25.290
Murder them all!

00:02:27.370 --> 00:02:28.790
Damn it!

00:02:28.790 --> 00:02:30.370
Avenge him!

00:03:02.570 --> 00:03:05.120
<i>It's over...</i>

00:03:06.330 --> 00:03:07.580
<i>Oh, heavens...</i>

00:03:08.910 --> 00:03:10.040
<i>Why have you...</i>

00:03:13.880 --> 00:03:16.000
Princess, stand up!

00:03:17.100 --> 00:03:18.550
It's finished.

00:03:19.260 --> 00:03:20.630
It doesn't matter now.

00:03:20.630 --> 00:03:22.090
What are you saying?

00:03:22.630 --> 00:03:24.680
Remember the emperor's words!

00:03:24.680 --> 00:03:27.180
If even one of us survives, we win!

00:03:27.180 --> 00:03:29.480
None of us will survive.

00:03:29.480 --> 00:03:31.730
Jinzaburou is dead.

00:03:32.190 --> 00:03:34.060
What can we do on our own?

00:03:34.060 --> 00:03:36.730
He... Kuchii Jinzaburou...

00:03:36.730 --> 00:03:39.140
wouldn't die from such a thing.

00:03:39.480 --> 00:03:43.110
He died in an explosion! 
There's nothing left!

00:03:43.110 --> 00:03:45.780
No, I saw him fall into the sea.

00:03:46.530 --> 00:03:47.660
Is that true?

00:03:47.660 --> 00:03:49.540
Is that true, Gontarou?

00:03:49.540 --> 00:03:51.000
Yes...

00:03:51.000 --> 00:03:52.960
Gontarou, there's a way out.

00:03:54.000 --> 00:03:55.630
This way, everyone!

00:03:59.880 --> 00:04:03.760
There's a small cave 
past this plain of ferns.

00:04:03.760 --> 00:04:05.930
It's too small for grown-ups to enter.

00:04:05.930 --> 00:04:07.470
We can rest there.

00:04:09.520 --> 00:04:11.100
Nice and easy.

00:04:13.690 --> 00:04:15.980
They're coming this way, searching 
the ground beneath their feet.

00:04:15.980 --> 00:04:17.230
Do we turn back?

00:04:18.480 --> 00:04:19.440
Impossible.

00:04:19.440 --> 00:04:20.440
They're behind us, as well.

00:04:22.400 --> 00:04:25.060
I'll just fling this at them...

00:04:25.610 --> 00:04:27.120
But I need a fire!

00:04:31.450 --> 00:04:33.040
Listen carefully, Sana.

00:04:33.040 --> 00:04:36.170
I'm going to stick 
this explosive inside the fire.

00:04:36.960 --> 00:04:40.800
When it blows up, 
it will distract the Mongols.

00:04:40.800 --> 00:04:42.510
When that happens, run straight ahead.

00:04:42.510 --> 00:04:44.760
I'll jump into the sea to escape

00:04:44.760 --> 00:04:46.760
and meet up with you when it's dark.

00:04:46.760 --> 00:04:47.760
Amushi...

00:04:49.300 --> 00:04:54.640
Do you regret not leaving 
the island last night on that ship?

00:04:55.640 --> 00:04:56.700
Is now the time?

00:04:56.700 --> 00:04:58.270
Now is the only time!

00:04:58.270 --> 00:05:00.680
I want to know because of 
everything that's going on.

00:05:01.690 --> 00:05:05.150
Nobody's left for me 
in the capital city of Kyoto.

00:05:06.070 --> 00:05:09.580
Maybe this will be my new capital.

00:05:12.330 --> 00:05:14.000
Okay, off I go.

00:05:14.000 --> 00:05:15.170
Stay sharp.

00:05:22.340 --> 00:05:23.130
Japanese!

00:05:24.050 --> 00:05:25.120
Idiot!

00:05:25.800 --> 00:05:27.550
Stupid brat...

00:05:28.220 --> 00:05:29.070
Amushi!

00:05:30.550 --> 00:05:31.930
Get off me!

00:05:34.890 --> 00:05:36.020
Don't underestimate me.

00:05:36.020 --> 00:05:38.810
Would they send a normal kid 
into the middle of nowhere like this?

00:05:39.550 --> 00:05:40.560
After him!

00:05:40.560 --> 00:05:41.400
Don't let him get away!

00:05:41.400 --> 00:05:42.270
Where's Sana?

00:05:44.780 --> 00:05:45.780
Amushi!

00:05:52.370 --> 00:05:54.580
<i>Is that you, Sana?</i>

00:05:55.250 --> 00:05:57.080
<i>She's like a fish...</i>

00:05:57.710 --> 00:06:00.250
<i>She's so... pretty...</i>

00:06:04.960 --> 00:06:07.550
Amushi!

00:06:12.100 --> 00:06:14.970
We're fine. Let's keep going.

00:06:14.970 --> 00:06:17.690
The Mongols won't come 
this far to smoke us out.

00:06:20.270 --> 00:06:23.070
Is someone there?

00:06:25.940 --> 00:06:26.930
Gontarou!

00:06:27.700 --> 00:06:28.830
Mongols!

00:06:29.790 --> 00:06:31.660
Damn you!

00:06:33.660 --> 00:06:35.290
Open a path!

00:06:35.290 --> 00:06:36.870
The princess is coming through!

00:06:38.620 --> 00:06:40.040
Kaitani-dono!

00:06:41.380 --> 00:06:42.460
Wha—

00:06:49.340 --> 00:06:53.350
I can still fight!

00:06:57.600 --> 00:06:59.020
Gontarou!

00:07:03.420 --> 00:07:04.290
Kano...

00:07:06.440 --> 00:07:07.690
Protect...

00:07:08.820 --> 00:07:10.200
the princess...

00:07:14.660 --> 00:07:17.200
I will...

00:07:19.080 --> 00:07:20.080
Gontarou!

00:07:22.830 --> 00:07:24.750
Princess, this way!

00:07:25.130 --> 00:07:26.210
Wait!

00:07:26.210 --> 00:07:27.630
Gontarou is still...

00:07:38.680 --> 00:07:39.650
Kano...?

00:07:40.090 --> 00:07:41.230
What's wrong?

00:07:42.520 --> 00:07:43.690
Princess...

00:07:46.320 --> 00:07:47.510
What are you—

00:07:47.510 --> 00:07:50.030
This is the end!

00:07:51.570 --> 00:07:54.820
Please forgive me, Princess!

00:07:55.660 --> 00:07:57.660
Ka...no...

00:08:01.210 --> 00:08:02.210
Wait...

00:08:02.960 --> 00:08:05.410
Jinzaburou may still be alive!

00:08:06.130 --> 00:08:10.630
At least... at least let me 
see him again, one more time!

00:08:27.150 --> 00:08:30.110
Search this area for Japanese!

00:08:30.940 --> 00:08:32.030
Over here!

00:08:32.030 --> 00:08:33.070
A woman!

00:08:33.070 --> 00:08:34.570
Don't hurt her!

00:08:41.290 --> 00:08:42.790
Damn you!

00:08:55.050 --> 00:08:57.050
—Kamakura, four years ago

00:08:57.180 --> 00:09:00.760
Kuchii Household

00:09:01.770 --> 00:09:05.100
Mother, will it bear fruit next year?

00:09:05.100 --> 00:09:08.110
Maybe. I hope it does soon.

00:09:08.650 --> 00:09:10.520
Give me a whole basket full, okay?

00:09:12.230 --> 00:09:15.740
Do not plant trees 
in the mansion of the Kuchii!

00:09:18.160 --> 00:09:20.530
Don't let a girl play with the soil.

00:09:20.530 --> 00:09:22.240
I'm sorry.

00:09:22.240 --> 00:09:23.840
Goodbye.

00:09:30.670 --> 00:09:32.420
You would disobey your father, then?

00:09:32.840 --> 00:09:35.300
I-I'll do the best I can...

00:09:36.340 --> 00:09:38.300
Th-That's what you always say!

00:09:38.300 --> 00:09:43.220
You say that's how a samurai must be!

00:09:43.680 --> 00:09:47.140
This persimmon tree is my dear friend!

00:09:47.140 --> 00:09:50.650
I'll do the best I can to protect it!

00:09:52.320 --> 00:09:57.610
So you'll do the best you can 
to protect that one spot?

00:09:58.070 --> 00:09:59.740
It won't be easy.

00:09:59.740 --> 00:10:03.120
You won't be able to complain, 
even if I strike you down where you stand!

00:10:06.120 --> 00:10:07.620
I understand...

00:10:08.330 --> 00:10:12.630
I won't move until the persimmon blossoms!

00:10:12.630 --> 00:10:13.880
Very well.

00:10:13.880 --> 00:10:15.130
You won't take that back, will you?

00:10:15.800 --> 00:10:18.800
If you can do it, that spot will be yours.

00:10:24.890 --> 00:10:26.480
I'm not scared...

00:10:30.150 --> 00:10:31.360
There's someone there.

00:10:32.360 --> 00:10:34.610
What? A kid?

00:10:36.610 --> 00:10:38.240
Intruders!

00:10:38.240 --> 00:10:40.240
Damn it! Shut her up!

00:10:47.040 --> 00:10:51.330
Did you know this was the mansion 
of Kuchii Jinzaburou when you came in?

00:10:51.330 --> 00:10:52.460
Be careful.

00:10:52.460 --> 00:10:54.040
He's a master of the Gikei-style sword.

00:10:54.960 --> 00:10:56.460
Sword?

00:10:56.460 --> 00:10:59.930
All I need is this bamboo to defeat you!

00:11:03.180 --> 00:11:05.260
If they're thieves, 
take them to the garrison.

00:11:05.260 --> 00:11:06.930
If they're assassins, 
kill them where they stand.

00:11:06.930 --> 00:11:07.730
Yes, sir.

00:11:11.440 --> 00:11:12.690
Do you understand now?

00:11:13.190 --> 00:11:15.690
Sometimes, we get intruders like that.

00:11:15.690 --> 00:11:18.490
Trees give them a place to hide.

00:11:19.190 --> 00:11:20.700
I understand...

00:11:21.450 --> 00:11:22.490
But...

00:11:22.490 --> 00:11:25.450
This persimmon... You promised!

00:11:29.120 --> 00:11:30.580
That's right...

00:11:30.580 --> 00:11:32.080
You protected it to the end.

00:11:35.710 --> 00:11:38.760
Keep protecting that one place.

00:11:41.470 --> 00:11:44.140
But for today, come inside and rest.

00:11:48.520 --> 00:11:50.480
You kept that up every day, huh?

00:11:51.640 --> 00:11:53.720
Yes, Father.

00:11:54.810 --> 00:11:56.620
I did my best!

00:12:25.680 --> 00:12:29.640
<i>Foolish child of man...</i>

00:12:48.120 --> 00:12:49.330
<i>I'm alive...</i>

00:12:49.950 --> 00:12:51.950
<i>I survived?</i>

00:12:53.840 --> 00:12:55.880
<i>I didn't die...</i>

00:12:56.920 --> 00:12:59.340
<i>I can still fight!</i>

00:14:04.300 --> 00:14:05.450
You're that...

00:14:07.320 --> 00:14:08.820
You survived?

00:14:10.870 --> 00:14:12.240
I found you...

00:14:12.240 --> 00:14:14.290
You killed my father!

00:14:14.290 --> 00:14:18.660
This time, I'll kill you in a fair fight,

00:14:19.830 --> 00:14:21.910
like my father tried to do!

00:14:31.760 --> 00:14:33.060
That's right.

00:14:33.060 --> 00:14:34.430
That's what you should do.

00:14:34.430 --> 00:14:36.430
Avenge your father.

00:14:36.430 --> 00:14:38.810
That is the war you chose.

00:14:39.480 --> 00:14:43.800
And it's up to you and no one else 
when your war is over.

00:14:44.320 --> 00:14:46.810
Even if it's the end of the world.

00:14:49.200 --> 00:14:52.450
If you don't know how to use your sword, 
you can't even cut a shirt.

00:14:54.540 --> 00:14:56.880
Watch this, kid.

00:14:58.790 --> 00:15:00.170
I'll show you how it's done.

00:15:03.710 --> 00:15:07.670
We didn't get much for all that effort.

00:15:07.670 --> 00:15:10.380
We weren't expecting to.

00:15:10.380 --> 00:15:13.600
The goal was to get experience 
for our soldiers.

00:15:13.600 --> 00:15:15.430
We're returning to Sasu. Hurry.

00:15:17.890 --> 00:15:19.770
Everyone, board the ships!

00:15:19.770 --> 00:15:20.940
Start boarding!

00:15:20.940 --> 00:15:21.730
Hurry!

00:15:21.730 --> 00:15:23.110
Hurry it up!

00:15:21.730 --> 00:15:24.020
We're boarding the ships, they said.

00:15:24.020 --> 00:15:27.430
We're back to that hell below decks, huh?

00:15:27.810 --> 00:15:30.270
I wish they'd just leave us here.

00:15:31.790 --> 00:15:34.540
Hey. You're going to pay 
a price before you go.

00:15:34.540 --> 00:15:36.330
J-Japanese!

00:15:36.330 --> 00:15:38.160
One survived!

00:15:54.180 --> 00:15:55.510
Run! Hurry!

00:16:07.690 --> 00:16:08.810
Damn!

00:16:11.530 --> 00:16:13.280
Cowards.

00:16:13.280 --> 00:16:15.030
What is it that scares so you?

00:16:15.030 --> 00:16:19.070
It's just a filthy wolf...

00:16:19.070 --> 00:16:20.870
It's Ryuu Fukukou-sama!

00:16:21.360 --> 00:16:25.080
Look. In just four days 
since that night assault,

00:16:25.080 --> 00:16:29.180
the wolf has turned 
into a pathetic wild dog.

00:16:29.760 --> 00:16:32.640
Losing a war is a sad thing.

00:16:35.470 --> 00:16:36.270
Do you understand what this is?

00:16:36.930 --> 00:16:39.100
It's what's left of a weapon.

00:16:39.100 --> 00:16:43.230
It belonged to the man who was with you, 
the one with the face of an ogre...

00:16:48.110 --> 00:16:49.730
<i>Onitakemaru...</i>

00:16:50.320 --> 00:16:53.780
His blood was a brilliant red.

00:16:53.780 --> 00:16:55.910
What will yours look like?

00:16:55.910 --> 00:16:58.830
Is it worthy enough 
for my blade to drain it?

00:16:58.830 --> 00:17:02.920
You look like a stray dog, 
but are you still a wolf inside?

00:17:02.920 --> 00:17:04.670
He doesn't understand you.

00:17:04.670 --> 00:17:05.640
I don't care.

00:17:06.460 --> 00:17:08.990
Words mean nothing.

00:17:09.960 --> 00:17:14.130
What better way to understand someone 
than through lethal combat?

00:17:15.930 --> 00:17:17.140
Yeah...

00:17:19.170 --> 00:17:20.380
You're right...

00:17:20.850 --> 00:17:23.900
This will be the last battle

00:17:24.690 --> 00:17:26.520
on this island!

00:17:42.580 --> 00:17:43.990
It's a sad thing.

00:17:44.000 --> 00:17:47.080
The battle is already won!

00:17:47.080 --> 00:17:49.590
No matter what you do with that sword,

00:17:49.590 --> 00:17:53.590
it will never point toward victory!

00:17:55.670 --> 00:17:56.930
You don't understand?

00:17:57.630 --> 00:18:01.680
What are those sad swings of your blade for?

00:18:02.770 --> 00:18:04.020
Who are they for?

00:18:04.890 --> 00:18:08.190
There's nobody left!

00:18:08.190 --> 00:18:13.070
Or will you tell me that this is 
some feeble way of getting revenge?

00:18:16.780 --> 00:18:18.530
Revenge?

00:18:18.530 --> 00:18:20.040
Don't make me laugh!

00:18:40.380 --> 00:18:41.720
Damn you!

00:18:47.760 --> 00:18:49.980
Protect General Ryuu!

00:19:21.430 --> 00:19:23.170
It's not a war fought for a reason,

00:19:23.930 --> 00:19:26.420
or for someone else's sake.

00:19:26.420 --> 00:19:29.770
I'm fighting my own war.

00:19:32.970 --> 00:19:34.640
Just like everyone else...

00:19:37.400 --> 00:19:39.700
A war I can be proud of!

00:19:41.320 --> 00:19:45.910
Even you, a man possessed by battle, 
can understand that, right?

00:19:56.090 --> 00:19:59.340
<i>The Battle of Tsushima Island ended that day,</i>

00:19:59.340 --> 00:20:03.760
<i>with an overwhelming victory 
by the Mongol forces.</i>

00:20:08.430 --> 00:20:09.560
Kudoun-sama,

00:20:10.050 --> 00:20:16.620
General Kouchakyuu and General 
Ryuu Fukukou seem to be delayed.

00:20:16.980 --> 00:20:18.840
They should return soon.

00:20:19.140 --> 00:20:21.500
I heard this island was 
of no consequence at all.

00:20:22.030 --> 00:20:24.110
It seems we took longer than we thought.

00:20:25.780 --> 00:20:30.200
But that is how all battles 
with a new people are.

00:20:30.200 --> 00:20:35.000
Use the lessons you've learned here 
to fight even harder in Kyushu.

00:20:35.000 --> 00:20:36.790
<i>Kyushu Island, huh?</i>

00:20:37.800 --> 00:20:41.050
<i>If there are lots more like him...</i>

00:20:41.050 --> 00:20:43.300
<i>There's not a lot of reason for optimism.</i>

00:20:43.850 --> 00:20:49.460
Now, men, make these 
Japanese kneel before us.

00:20:49.970 --> 00:20:54.100
I'll be watching you!

00:21:16.180 --> 00:21:17.490
Where are the Mongols?

00:21:17.930 --> 00:21:19.060
Where is everyone?

00:21:19.830 --> 00:21:22.340
I was hidden by leaves?

00:21:26.440 --> 00:21:27.460
Kano!

00:21:48.670 --> 00:21:50.330
Jinzaburou?

00:21:53.660 --> 00:21:55.270
So you survived?

00:21:56.230 --> 00:21:59.250
Yes... I did.

00:22:00.210 --> 00:22:01.440
Just me...

00:22:02.140 --> 00:22:04.300
I was the only survivor...

00:22:05.420 --> 00:22:08.460
Surviving means winning.

00:22:13.590 --> 00:22:14.810
You...

00:22:16.320 --> 00:22:17.540
Princess!

00:22:17.540 --> 00:22:19.030
I'm so glad you're safe!

00:22:22.840 --> 00:22:26.160
You survived, too?

00:22:29.070 --> 00:22:30.240
Jinzaburou,

00:22:31.290 --> 00:22:34.240
Tsushima isn't finished yet!

00:22:35.030 --> 00:22:36.010
Yes...

00:22:40.470 --> 00:22:43.080
We can still fight!

00:23:26.270 --> 00:23:30.890
<i>There were exiles at Tsushima 
who fought the Mongols.</i>

00:23:32.310 --> 00:23:37.470
<i>The records of the Hachiman 
temples say this, but no more.</i>
